{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the absurd afterlife space (say goodbye to life-centered ideology!)  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich option branches  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person immersion experience  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich, mysterious, even cryptic texts and (beyond your imagination) inner monologues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Self-doubting games? Self-denying games? Self-shaping games!  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Might trigger thoughts about life)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606810/extras/bd57bab6af5a972e3efb50dbe951d8fb.avif?t=1764822587\" width=378 height=117 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You will start to...</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain perception.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discuss them with your inner speakers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open paths for yourself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606810/extras/cd3bed7dcd495aa4595dff10f2befeed.poster.avif?t=1764822587\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606810/extras/cd3bed7dcd495aa4595dff10f2befeed.webm?t=1764822587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606810/extras/cd3bed7dcd495aa4595dff10f2befeed.mp4?t=1764822587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A turn-based gameplay...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect DEAD chess pieces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play chess with mysterious opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Got to know <i>their</i> names.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606810/extras/8df25a88d6aca22aa07802304b087e33.poster.avif?t=1764822587\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606810/extras/8df25a88d6aca22aa07802304b087e33.webm?t=1764822587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606810/extras/8df25a88d6aca22aa07802304b087e33.mp4?t=1764822587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About localization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All texts translated from Chinese. If you have any questions about the translation, please contact!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking forward to receiving feedback and suggestions regarding &quot;DEATH CLUB: OUR DEAD PAWNS&quot;.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(As this game was developed by a solo developer, but she will try best to reply promptly!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606810/extras/7da3011506619efc11b21591fe19423d.avif?t=1764822587\" width=378 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3606810?t=1764822587"